  "I came to ERP through finance and internal audit, so I look at the close, the controls and the numbers first.": "我是从财务和内部审计转入ERP的，所以我首先看的是结账、内控和数字。",
  "I help leadership teams choose the right SAP, Oracle and Microsoft platforms, deliver programmes, fix reporting and put AI to work where it solves a real problem.": "我帮助管理层选对SAP、Oracle和Microsoft平台，推动项目交付，修复报表，并把AI用在真正能解决问题的地方。",
  "I help you assess and put AI to use, from enterprise and private AI to SAP Joule and practical applications for small businesses. Start with the task, the information involved and the controls the business needs.": "我帮助您评估并落地AI，从企业级AI、私有AI到SAP Joule，再到适合小企业的实用应用。先从任务、涉及的信息，以及业务所需的管控措施入手。",
  "I help you shape the data and reporting work behind better decisions, including Databricks and SAP Analytics Cloud. The starting point is what people need to know, not how many dashboards to build.": "我帮助您规划支撑更好决策的数据与报表工作，包括Databricks和SAP Analytics Cloud。起点是人们需要知道什么，而不是要做多少个仪表盘。",
  "I help you work through SAP, Oracle and Microsoft application decisions, connect the work to business processes and keep delivery focused on what the business needs.": "我帮助您理清SAP、Oracle和Microsoft应用方面的决策，把工作与业务流程衔接起来，让交付始终聚焦于业务真正需要的东西。",
  "I start with the business process and the numbers behind it, then decide which system, data or AI work earns its place. Not the other way round.": "我从业务流程及其背后的数字入手，再判断哪些系统、数据或AI工作值得做。而不是反过来。",
  "I work with your leadership team myself. No junior team learning on your budget.": "我亲自与您的管理层合作。不会让初级团队拿您的预算练手。",
  "I help your team pick the right platforms, deliver programmes, improve reporting and use AI where it solves real problems.": "我帮助您的团队选对平台、推动项目交付、改进报表，并把AI用在真正能解决问题的地方。",
  "I'm building an academy for consultants who want to use AI in their work, automate the repetitive parts and build practical tools. The first programme is AI Automation Practitioner.": "我正在为希望在工作中运用AI、自动化重复性工作并构建实用工具的咨询顾问打造一所学院。首个课程是AI Automation Practitioner。",
  "I've worked on.": "我亲身经手的。",
  "If this article touched on a programme you are live in right now, a 30-minute conversation usually gets further than another week of internal analysis.": "如果这篇文章谈到的正是您当前正在推进的项目，那么一次30分钟的交流，往往比再花一周做内部分析走得更远。",
  "If you are a consultant rather than a buyer, these two are for you: one for your CV and career, one for learning and my books.": "如果您是顾问而不是采购方，这两个站点适合您：一个面向简历与职业发展，一个面向学习和我的著作。",
  "If your current system needs adjusting rather than replacing, I'll tell you.": "如果您现有的系统只需要调整而不必更换，我会直接告诉您。",
