  "A private assistant for policy and procurement rules": "面向政策和采购规则的私有助手",
  "A government entity wanted staff to ask questions of its policies, circulars and procurement rules without sending documents to a public AI service. I helped pick the first use cases, set up the deployment so data stayed inside their environment, define who could see what, and build a test set of real questions to check answers before rollout.": "一家政府机构希望员工能就其政策、通告和采购规则提问，同时不把文件发送到公共AI服务。我协助确定了最先落地的使用场景，搭建了部署环境，让数据始终留在他们自己的环境内，定义了谁可以看到什么，并建立了一套由真实问题组成的测试集，在正式上线前核对答案。",
  "Aviation": "航空",
  "AI on finance exceptions": "用AI处理财务异常",
  "An airline's finance team spent days each month clearing invoice and payment exceptions. I helped design an AI step that reads each exception, suggests the likely cause and routes it to the right person, with a human approving every posting.": "一家航空公司的财务团队每个月都要花好几天时间处理发票和付款异常。我协助设计了一个AI环节：它会读取每一条异常，给出可能的原因，并转给合适的人，每一笔过账都由人工审批。",
  "Defence": "国防",
  "AI on a network with no internet access": "在无法访问互联网的网络中使用AI",
  "A defence manufacturer needed engineers to search technical documents and change records inside a restricted network. I helped choose a model that runs on their own infrastructure, set access by clearance, and decide what the assistant must never answer.": "一家国防制造企业需要让工程师在受限网络内检索技术文档和变更记录。我协助选择了可在其自有基础设施上运行的模型，按安全许可级别设置访问权限，并确定助手绝对不能回答的内容。",
  "Answers for store teams": "为门店团队提供答案",
  "A retailer's store teams asked the same product, stock and policy questions every day. I helped scope an assistant over approved product and policy content, reading stock from the ERP, with clear limits on what it could change.": "一家零售商的门店团队每天都在问同样的商品、库存和政策问题。我协助界定了一个助手的范围：基于已批准的商品与政策内容，从ERP读取库存，并明确限定它可以修改什么。",
  "Joule readiness": "Joule就绪度",
  "An SAP customer wanted to know what Joule would do for them. I worked out what their licence included, what had to be set up, and which processes were standard enough to benefit.": "一家SAP客户想知道Joule能为他们做什么。我梳理了他们的许可证包含哪些内容、需要完成哪些配置，以及哪些流程足够标准，可以从中受益。",
